   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 10 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14523 · Decision 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 21/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>10 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14523 · QĐ 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 21/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Understand the Principles of AI/ML/DL<br>Grasp the core concepts, the distinctions between Supervised and Unsupervised Learning, fundamental Neural Network architectures, and the standard workflow for building a foundational machine learning model.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Understand the Cybersecurity Context<br>Comprehend how AI is integrated into security architectures and identify specific cybersecurity challenges that are suitable for AI-driven solutions.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Apply Basic Probability and Statistics<br>Apply fundamental concepts of probability and statistics to model and analyze cybersecurity data, including estimating the likelihood of attack events and evaluating the reliability and statistical significance of detection results.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Apply Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) and Feature Engineering<br>Utilize programming tools (Python/Pandas) to collect, explore, and visualize cybersecurity data (such as system logs and network traffic). Execute data preprocessing and feature engineering techniques—including data cleaning, encoding, and feature extraction—to adequately prepare input data for machine learning models.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Apply Supervised and Unsupervised Learning<br>Implement supervised and unsupervised machine learning algorithms to develop models for intrusion detection, malware classification, and anomaly detection.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Apply Deep Learning and NLP for Security<br>Leverage Natural Language Processing (NLP) techniques to analyze and detect deceptive content, such as phishing and spam, within text and URLs.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Performance Analysis<br><br>Analyze experimental results using a Confusion Matrix and key performance metrics (Precision, Recall, and F1-score), evaluating the operational impact of False Positives and False Negatives in real-world security environments.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Apply Imbalanced Data Handling<br><br>Employ data preprocessing techniques, such as resampling and class weighting, to resolve challenges associated with imbalanced datasets.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Analyze AI Risks and Apply LLMs in Cybersecurity<br><br>Analyze model vulnerabilities, specifically adversarial attacks, and evaluate emerging threats introduced by Generative AI, such as deepfakes and automated social engineering. Furthermore, apply Large Language Models (LLMs) and agentic AI frameworks to address and resolve complex cybersecurity challenges.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Apply Project Development<br>Synthesize acquired knowledge and utilize collaborative teamwork skills to design, implement, and present an end-to-end AI pipeline addressing a real-world cybersecurity problem.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
