   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>Machine Learning and Security: Protecting Systems with Data and Algorithms</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14523 · Decision 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 21/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Machine Learning and Security: Protecting Systems with Data and Algorithms</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14523 · QĐ 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 21/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Machine Learning and Security: Protecting Systems with Data and Algorithms</strong></td><td>Clarence Chio, David Freeman</td><td>O’Reilly</td><td>2018</td><td>1st</td><td><code>9781491979907</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>[Chio2018]</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Introduction to Machine Learning, fourth edition (Adaptive Computation and Machine Learning series)</strong></td><td>Ethem Alpaydin</td><td>The MIT Press</td><td>2020</td><td>4th</td><td><code>978-0262043793</code></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>[Alpaydin2020]</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>ChatGPT for Cybersecurity Cookbook: Learn practical generative AI recipes to supercharge your cybersecurity skills</strong></td><td>Clint Bodungen</td><td>Packt Publishing</td><td>2024</td><td>1st</td><td><code>978-1805124047</code></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>[Bodungen2023]</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Machine Learning for Cybersecurity Cookbook: Over 80 recipes on how to implement machine learning algorithms for building security systems using Python</strong></td><td>Emmanuel Tsukerman</td><td>Packt Publishing</td><td>2019</td><td>1st</td><td><code>978-1789614671</code></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>[Tsukerman2019]</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Hands-On Machine Learning for Cybersecurity</strong></td><td>Soma Halder, Sinan Ozdemir</td><td>Packt Publishing</td><td>2018</td><td>1st</td><td><code>978-1788992282</code></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>[Halder2018]</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>- Language: Python 3.11+<br><br>- Jupyter notebook<br><br>- Google Colab<br><br>- Scikit-learn, Numpy, Pandas, Pytorch,…</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>- Language: Python 3.11+<br><br>- Jupyter notebook<br><br>- Google Colab<br><br>- Scikit-learn, Numpy, Pandas, Pytorch,…</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14523</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
